 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2474  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2474) 'The full 2,600-position pass was still rendering at the time of this draft. `DROP_IDS` is provisional until that pass completes and confirms no additional ids fail.
